はクラシック音楽が好きなため、時おり「リズムが混ざる」との事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒影の意思を最も濃く継いでいるため、常に『正義』とは何かを考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"絶対的な正義を志しているが、その考えはあまりにも極端で、悪忍は全て滅ぼす、悪に慣れ合う善も必要ないなど行き過ぎたものとなっている。そのため焔達と関係を持つ飛鳥達ですら不快感を示し、倒そうとしていたが、飛鳥や焔と刃を交える内に考えを改め始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに彼女のアーケード任務では『正義』に関して一つの答えに到着するが、あまりにも曲解かつ飛躍していたために四季を大いに引かせていた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21789"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"兴趣","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21789","value":"书法"},{"label":"喜欢的食物","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21789","value":"刨冰(红豆口味)"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba18616db0d273c4ac4b6c550fbc27ce31f595ecde4079f9693e52d1f7c41ddb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f1539c1dd0d8cff9c4a7a7c18d24099ca616bd40f8ca848a24d4ad95ced2c09.webp","width":161,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"原由実","creatorId":"vndb:s3261","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3261","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3261","name":"原 由実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:288017:21789:5825:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_32074","characterName":"むらさき","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"32074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"108440"},{"characterId":"32074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"194888"},{"characterId":"32074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"221228"},{"characterId":"32074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"223001"},{"characterId":"32074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"288017"}]},"originalCharacterName":"むらさき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"1026"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"bust